WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.875
- No, no, no, no, no, no. Don't turn it over again, Jameis. Not again.

00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:03.708
- HELLO, JAMEIS.

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:06.250
- I’m not supposed to talk to strangers, or the media, or my teammates—

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.166
- I’m Franchise, the dependable clown. 
Would you like to join me-

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:11.541
Oh your decision-making just naturally puts you in the sewer?

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:12.958
OK, this was easy.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.250
- Welcome to a meeting of the fluffing losers club. 

00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:20.958
- I haven’t seen you guys since our rookie year. Why now?

00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:24.375
- The evil clown is back, and it’s going to terrorize. 
Gridiron Heights with everyone’s worst fears!

00:00:24.416 --> 00:00:25.500
- Wait, where’s Ben?

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:26.958
- BACK UP, BACKUPS! 

00:00:26.958 --> 00:00:28.625
- 🎶RUDOLPH THE BROWN-NOSING STARTER. 🎶

00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:29.666
- [Evilly:] QUACK QUACK QUACK QUACK QUACK.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.500
- Flipping CLOWN not gonna fudging get ME.

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:32.750
- We made a deal. Remember?

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.791
- YOU’LL NEVER DEFEAT ME, 2004 DRAFT CLASS.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.416
-I’m fluffing Phil Rivers, and you don’t
froggin’ mess with New York! 

00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:42.416
- 🎶YOU CAN’T WIN THE AFC. 🎶

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.458
- Sorry, San Diego.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:46.541
- Eli frogging stole my life!

00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:49.125
- Chirp chirp. You’ll lose forever, Larry.

00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:51.708
- No, 2004 is our last rebuild!

00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:53.041
- I’ll be back!

00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:55.333
- I don't get why they don't just run through each other.

00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:57.333
- Don't question it. We're just a PlayStation ad.

00:00:57.375 --> 00:00:59.916
- PlayStation 4, the best place to play.

00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:02.291
- Can’t frickin’ believe we gotta save the GD day again.

00:01:02.416 --> 00:01:03.041
- What’s this?

00:01:03.041 --> 00:01:03.875
Oh no! 

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:05.583
IT’S DANGEROUS TO RUN.

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:07.833
- MAKE THE STRANGE MAN GO AWAY.

00:01:08.041 --> 00:01:10.625
- NO! Well, you know, maybe I could start…BUT NO.

00:01:10.708 --> 00:01:11.541
- AHHH!!!

00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:12.458
- Look, it’s not real! 

00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:14.500
- YOU’LL NEVER BE PHILLY SPECIAL!

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.083
- AHHHHHHHH!

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:17.208
- Hey there monster, what’s new with you? 

00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:19.000
- You don't get to play for two weeks.

00:01:19.166 --> 00:01:19.708
-AHHHHHHHHH!

00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:21.500
- YOU’RE MINE, MARIOTA.

00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:22.416
- It’s not real.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:24.333
- Um, I think that’s actually Ryan Tannehill. 

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:25.125
- THIS WAY!

00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:27.875
- OK, well Larry is clearly a Hall of Famer, right?

00:01:27.916 --> 00:01:28.958
- Eli has the rings.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.166
- But Phil’s consistency, my God!

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.125
- [All three:] AHHHH!

00:01:32.916 --> 00:01:34.666
- 🎶You don’t inspire us! 🎶

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.500
- I’VE TRIED TO GIVE BACK TO THE GAME AS MUCH AS IT’S GIVEN TO ME!

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:38.833
- Everyone doggon loves you.

00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:39.833
- That means a lot. 

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.666
- YOU’LL THROW FLOATERS TOO. 

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.375
- It’s me. Matt Shaub! Also 2004 draft class!

00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:46.750
- Oh, yeah.
- AHHH!
- Oh my God!

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.916
- Don’t hurt me, Eli.

00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:50.916
- I can’t...But he can.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.041
- Hey, 2004 Eli,  F--K you.

00:01:53.291 --> 00:01:53.791
- WOAH.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.500
- I’m a Hall of Famer...to my friends.

00:01:57.541 --> 00:01:59.875
- OK, SO, UH, OUR DRAFT CLASS WILL JUST STAY HERE?

